<title>USA: Roche, ArQule in three-year pact.</title>
<headline>Roche, ArQule in three-year pact.</headline>
<dateline>MEDFORD, Mass. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roche Holding Ltd unit Roche Bioscience and ArQule Inc said on Monday they had signed a three-year pact for drug discovery and development.</p>
<p>ArQule will apply its &quot;molecular building block&quot; technology aimed at speeding up the refining of therapeutic leads into clinical candidates, the companies said.</p>
<p>Roche Bioscience will provide research funding and milestone payments to ArQule.  Royalties are also payable to ArQule on the sales of any drugs that result from the collaboration.  Specific financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1733</p>
</text>
